# Facebook comment auto-replies

Owner: `lib/facebook-comment-reply.js`. Real questions use **RAG**. Do **not** paste website-chat canned answers (`whoIsJulieAnswer`, `ageCarrierFitAnswer`, phone CTAs) into a public comment. `lockedFacebookAnswer()` is only a fallback if RAG is empty.

## Style

- First reply: thank them; automated assistant of Mejor Vida Seguros; Julie was notified and will **private-message**; then one simple public answer.
- Later replies: skip that intro. 1–2 short **usted** sentences. “Si tiene otra pregunta, puede escribirla aquí.”
- Bare INFO / Information / REVISAR: intro only. No blog URL.
- Public-facing only: no phones, emails, URLs, licensed-state roster, mailing address, sample monthly prices, or carrier shopping lists unless they named a carrier.
- Negative / hostile comments (scam, insult, “don’t buy this,” rant with no product question): **skip RAG**. Thank them (first name if Facebook sent it). Do not argue, joke, lecture, or say “that’s why you should plan.” Julie will private-message. If they also asked a cost / eligibility / who-is-Julie question, answer that locked line only.

```js
// BAD — website chat
"Nació en Bogotá… https://…/about-julie.html Llámala al 402-440-5438"

// GOOD — Facebook comment
"Julie Braunsroth es la fundadora de Mejor Vida Seguros y una agente de seguros licenciada (NPN #21695431). Ella es quien le enviará el mensaje privado."
```
